        "created_at": "2011-09-12T15:40:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>During a game we played last weekend, a friend of mine was playing as Tempest. He had 2 copies of one of his power cards down (I believe it healed 2 hp). If you have 2 copies of the same power down ( and obviously if its not a limited), will it increase the effect of the power (heal 4 hp instead of 2)?</p>\n<p>We thought that may be the case, as being able to play more than 2 of the same card would be completely pointless otherwise ,unless you happen to have one of the Heroes that can use more than 1 power, which I believe tempest cannot.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:46.663Z",
