        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-13T02:11:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No universes will end this time I promise <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>If you have two copies of Cleansing Downpour in play (which, incidentally, reads “<span class=\"bbcode-b\">Power</span>: Each Hero regains 2 HP.”), you can use either “instance” of the power on your power phase, but in either case, the power will simply work as written (i.e., each hero will regain 2 HP).  If for any reason you can use an additional power on your turn, you may opt to use both “instances” of the power on Cleansing Downpour since they come from different distinct cards.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
